# Tests

Write the failing test first, then the code, then clean up.

- No `time.sleep` or `asyncio.sleep` in tests. Use `await pilot.pause()` or assert on callbacks and fixture state.
- Database tests use `test_db` (`SqliteDatabase(":memory:")`). Do not write `~/.local/share/ytmusic-tui/ytmusic.db`.
- Reset `AppState` between tests.
- Unit tests use `mock_youtube` and `mock_player`. Do not hit the network or play audio.
- Files: `tests/test_<feature>.py`. Names: `test_<target>_<scenario>_<expected_outcome>()`.
